    "name": "Dino Tower Arena",
    "steam_appid": 2555830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Tower Arena is a action roguelite game where you can build your dinosaur with different abilities and put it into fights against waves of enemy dinos, upgrading it with new abilities, boosting its stats and unlocking new dinosaurs while advancing on the floors of the enormous Dino Tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Feature list </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get into intense fights </strong>against dozens of enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrade your dino</strong> between each level and become a walking catastrophy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get lots of different skills </strong> like poison, fire balls and assassin shurikens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Unlock new dinosaurs </strong> and play with your favorite killing machine! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upload your scores to a leaderboard </strong> and become the very best!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/558645267493f0c42368fcc3d3716858.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dino Tower Arena is a action roguelite game where you can build your dinosaur with different abilities and put it into fights against waves of enemy dinos, upgrading it with new abilities, boosting its stats and unlocking new dinosaurs while advancing on the floors of the enormous Dino Tower!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/901a032e7f1a717f8eba2b2771f0e161.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.poster.avif?t=1754490914\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.webm?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2555830/extras/b7fc5876df4cea3fc84a2c7ff947672e.mp4?t=1754490914\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Feature list </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get into intense fights </strong>against dozens of enemies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upgrade your dino</strong> between each level and become a walking catastrophy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Get lots of different skills </strong> like poison, fire balls and assassin shurikens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong> Unlock new dinosaurs </strong> and play with your favorite killing machine! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Upload your scores to a leaderboard </strong> and become the very best!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "OVERPOWERED DINOSAURS fighting to DEATH!!! Fight against unending waves of dinosaur enemies and get crazy upgrade combinations to become the strongest dinosaur in this arena shooter!",
